The token sequence construction, question rendering, confidence calculation,
tokenizer wrapper, and the Snake game rules, cycle safety planner and decision
policy are adapted from laya-mlx.

Inference runs through PyAXEngine (https://github.com/AXERA-TECH/pyaxengine),
following the reference infer.py published in the AXERA-TECH/Laya deployment
package (https://huggingface.co/AXERA-TECH/Laya, Apache-2.0).

Model weights are downloaded separately from the AXERA-TECH/Laya package on
Hugging Face; they are not included in this repository.
